@startuml KTOB_15_state_memory
title KTOB - AI Memory Proposal / Approved Memory Lifecycle
[*] --> PENDING : candidate proposed, not approved
PENDING --> APPROVED : reader approves (optionally edits)
PENDING --> DISMISSED : reader dismisses
APPROVED --> REVOKED : DELETE /memories/{id}
DISMISSED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]
note right of APPROVED
One proposal creates at most one approved memory.
PATCH updates text only. No active=true reactivation.
end note
note bottom of REVOKED
Terminal: a new approval needs a new proposal.
Revoked content is excluded from AI context.
end note
@enduml
